","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"144"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The young, pint-sized proprietress of a long-established alchemy shop."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She laments how technology has pushed alchemy into decline and throws herself into reviving it, spreading the word day after day through outreach."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the protagonist's childhood friend, and often fusses over him like a doting big sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NookGaming"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c117559"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"老舗錬金術用品店を営む、若き小さな店長さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テクノロジーの普及によって錬金術が衰退した現状を嘆いており、持ち前の行動力で錬金術の復興を目指し日々普及活動を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼馴染みであり、姉のように世話を焼くこともしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24323","sourceWorkId":"33148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"老舗錬金術用品店を営む、若き小さな店長さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テクノロジーの普及によって錬金術が衰退した現状を嘆いており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"持ち前の行動力で錬金術の復興を目指し日々普及活動を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼馴染みであり、姉のように世話を焼くこともしばしば。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115494"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4ba7105cc81619307e02d6e71ead744d57bf964bfc55e92b989c3af63b7cf43.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab3310841d960c742fcb8fc4c2656b4d1c8d4612debc7ad22fa0940f670e43f0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天知遥","creatorId":"vndb:s16012","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16012","canonicalEntit